{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The demon army launched a comprehensive attack, and with the help of various characters, the brave need to rely on their own wisdom to solve the crisis and restore world peace. </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Game features: </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 1. The focus is on thinking about what to do next, such as fighting monsters, collecting or talking to computer characters </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 2. It is necessary to allocate attribute points reasonably to ensure one's strength </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 3. You can retract the operation at any time and go back to the past, even if you have already died </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 4. There is only one large map level without any scene switching </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> 5. There are no random events, and the same state and operation will only produce the same result </p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3554100?t=1743601166","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554100/7f1bf48ac024c999408668b7c51d626d07e7a607/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1743601166","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554100/37969e6daf1390e9786bfc4c4f30c1b9407d9668/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1743601166","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3554100/37969e6daf1390e9786bfc4c4f30c1b9407d9668/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1743601166","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Achievements","id":22},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> The demon army launched a comprehensive attack, and with the help of various characters, the brave need to rely on their own wisdom to solve the crisis and restore world peace. </p> <p class=\"bb_paragraph\"> Game fea